    "name": "Mamorukun ReCurse!",
    "steam_appid": 3273980,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/6a597864f13f69cc6ae261dd007fb5a4.poster.avif?t=1753263725\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/6a597864f13f69cc6ae261dd007fb5a4.webm?t=1753263725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Where am I?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approaching headlights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just as he thought he was about to be hit by a car, time passed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When he came to, Mamorukun found himself in a mysterious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hi everyone~! Welcome to the Netherworld!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to the Netherworld shrine maiden &quot;Jigokudani Fururu, &quot;she summoned &quot;chosen souls&quot; to save the Netherworld from crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignoring the protests of the boys and girls gathered with Mamorukun,Fururu continued her explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, someone is trying to open the gate to the &quot;Dark World&quot; in the Netherworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a result, the residents of the Netherworld are cursed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save the Netherworld, you must purify the residents and prevent the gate to the Dark World from opening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Now, brave ones! Work hard for the Netherworld!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus, the battle of Mamorukun and the others, summoned to the Netherworld to return to their original world, begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/01e5503753fdcac1714907a3208ed681.poster.avif?t=1753263725\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/01e5503753fdcac1714907a3208ed681.webm?t=1753263725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the main shot, you can use &quot;curse bullets&quot; powered by each character's attached spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quick tap fires a &quot;small curse bullet&quot; that lands directly in front of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touching the deployed curse field curses both enemies and yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holding the button charges a &quot;large curse bullet&quot; that flies far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The initial shockwave can erase enemy bullets and grants brief invincibility!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed enemies continuously take damage. Defeating them yields many score items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're cursed, your power and speed increase for a certain time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, while cursed, you can't shoot curse bullets, and once the curse ends, your power decreases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the power of curses to advance through the vast Netherworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/f3664ab98cc341a410c73b3efa0f3d8e.poster.avif?t=1753263725\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/f3664ab98cc341a410c73b3efa0f3d8e.webm?t=1753263725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6GAME MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Mode: Play the 2008 arcade version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select stages and tackle missions while managing activity time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode: Introduced in the 2009 home version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch characters and aim to conquer all five worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Netherworld Action Mode: Added in the 2011 home version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose three characters and challenge predetermined courses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title includes all past game modes, characters, costumes, and missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode now supports widescreen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, it features Gallery Mode and Online Rankings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/ff952f792e309382c5e7772d3b42539c.poster.avif?t=1753263725\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/ff952f792e309382c5e7772d3b42539c.webm?t=1753263725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6SOUND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with the hit track &quot;YO-KAI Disco,&quot; widely known even beyond game fans,this title includes all BGM from the original and arranged versions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It offers a custom function to play your favorite BGM versions by mode or stage,and a sound test to listen to all tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also includes a new theme song by original composer Yousuke Yasui!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/6a597864f13f69cc6ae261dd007fb5a4.poster.avif?t=1753263725\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/6a597864f13f69cc6ae261dd007fb5a4.webm?t=1753263725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Where am I?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approaching headlights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just as he thought he was about to be hit by a car, time passed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When he came to, Mamorukun found himself in a mysterious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hi everyone~! Welcome to the Netherworld!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >According to the Netherworld shrine maiden &quot;Jigokudani Fururu, &quot;she summoned &quot;chosen souls&quot; to save the Netherworld from crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ignoring the protests of the boys and girls gathered with Mamorukun,Fururu continued her explanation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, someone is trying to open the gate to the &quot;Dark World&quot; in the Netherworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a result, the residents of the Netherworld are cursed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To save the Netherworld, you must purify the residents and prevent the gate to the Dark World from opening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Now, brave ones! Work hard for the Netherworld!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thus, the battle of Mamorukun and the others, summoned to the Netherworld to return to their original world, begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/01e5503753fdcac1714907a3208ed681.poster.avif?t=1753263725\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/01e5503753fdcac1714907a3208ed681.webm?t=1753263725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to the main shot, you can use &quot;curse bullets&quot; powered by each character's attached spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A quick tap fires a &quot;small curse bullet&quot; that lands directly in front of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touching the deployed curse field curses both enemies and yourself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Holding the button charges a &quot;large curse bullet&quot; that flies far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The initial shockwave can erase enemy bullets and grants brief invincibility!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed enemies continuously take damage. Defeating them yields many score items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you're cursed, your power and speed increase for a certain time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, while cursed, you can't shoot curse bullets, and once the curse ends, your power decreases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the power of curses to advance through the vast Netherworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/f3664ab98cc341a410c73b3efa0f3d8e.poster.avif?t=1753263725\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/f3664ab98cc341a410c73b3efa0f3d8e.webm?t=1753263725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6GAME MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Mode: Play the 2008 arcade version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select stages and tackle missions while managing activity time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode: Introduced in the 2009 home version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch characters and aim to conquer all five worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Netherworld Action Mode: Added in the 2011 home version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose three characters and challenge predetermined courses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title includes all past game modes, characters, costumes, and missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Mode now supports widescreen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, it features Gallery Mode and Online Rankings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/ff952f792e309382c5e7772d3b42539c.poster.avif?t=1753263725\" width=620 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3273980/extras/ff952f792e309382c5e7772d3b42539c.webm?t=1753263725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6SOUND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with the hit track &quot;YO-KAI Disco,&quot; widely known even beyond game fans,this title includes all BGM from the original and arranged versions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It offers a custom function to play your favorite BGM versions by mode or stage,and a sound test to listen to all tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also includes a new theme song by original composer Yousuke Yasui!</p>",
